# What each product's install copies, and nothing more.
#
# hooks    the hook scripts, and the registrations that name them
# rules    rules/reply-shape.md, which a hook prints at session start
# skills   the three skills, each carrying its page
# commands the menu entries that invoke those skills
# cloud    the install, refresh and merge scripts a container runs
# shim     the Pi extension, which runs the hooks itself

claude-code: hooks rules skills commands
claude-cloud: hooks rules skills commands cloud
codex: hooks rules skills commands
pi: hooks rules shim
chat-cowork: skills
